                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Why hello there, young Wizard. By the Great Dragon's shiniest scale... this place never seemed as busy as when it lies in ruins! I hope I can help you... but I warn you that things are in a bit of a shambles.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_M_wizard_base_1_Ghost_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_DS|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/MilosBookwyrm_QST_50.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 126293,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DS-LIB-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "A twin collar for a demon dog? Obviously, there's nothing like that here in the Atheneum. However, you're in luck, or at least something close to lucky!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_M_wizard_base_1_Ghost_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_DS|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/MilosBookwyrm_QST_51.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 126293,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DS-LIB-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Ranulf Moonclaw, a collector of rare beasts, had a few two-headed pets over the years. I suspect that Ranulf and his menagerie met their end in his tower, though this ghost-haunted place might make the search a perilous one.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_M_wizard_base_1_Ghost_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_DS|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/MilosBookwyrm_QST_52.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 126293,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "DS-LIB-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "So that is all the advice I can give you: go to the tower of Ranulf Moonclaw and see if a suitable collar for your two-headed demon dog Orthrus can be found therein. You can find Moonclaw's tower in the Labyrinth.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_M_wizard_base_1_Ghost_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_DS|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/MilosBookwyrm_QST_53.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 126293,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
