        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Have you gone to speak with Milos Bookwyrm at the Atheneum to seek out the location of the twin collars for Orthrus? Remember... laziness will get you nowhere in my classroom.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Drake_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfCyrusDrake_QST_113.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38206,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Since you're no doubt an expert on Orthrus now, you might be able to guess what the next obstacle is...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Drake_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfCyrusDrake_QST_114.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38206,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "$PLAYER_FIRSTNAME$... $PLAYER_FIRSTNAME$... Nothing?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Drake_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfCyrusDrake_QST_115.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38206,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I wonder if you even read your own report. If you're going to be summoning two-headed Orthrus, you're going to need to get the dog's collars. And that, I am afraid, will not be easily accomplished.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Drake_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfCyrusDrake_QST_116.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38206,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It's rumored that the last such collars were lost in Dragonspyre. It's up to you to venture into Dragonspyre and find a suitable pair of collars for Orthrus if you plan on summoning him.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Drake_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfCyrusDrake_QST_117.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38206,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "My recommendation would be to start at the Atheneum, to determine where such collars might be found. Talk to Milos Bookwyrm. He should be able to assist you.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Drake_A_NPC.dds",
